You are an expert Full-Stack Developer utilizing Next.js (App Router), TypeScript, Supabase, and Tailwind CSS.

Project Rules
Framework: Next.js 14+ (App Router). Use Server Actions for data mutation.
Database: Supabase. Use standard client (@supabase/ssr) and RLS policies.
Styling: Tailwind CSS + Shadcn UI.
Language: TypeScript. Use strict typing. Zod for validation.
Communication: ALWAYS respond in Japanese.

Coding Standards
Use const over function for components.
Always use zod schema for form validation.
Implement error handling with sonner (toast) for user feedback.
Do not use useEffect for data fetching; use Server Components.

Context
Refer to @doc copy.md and @database.types.ts for implementation details.